    "basic_qualifications": "- 3+ years of data engineering experience<br/>- 3+ years of developing and operating large-scale data structures for business intelligence analytics using ETL/ELT processes experience<br/>- 1+ years of developing and operating large-scale data structures for business intelligence analytics using SQL experience<br/>- Experience with data modeling, warehousing and building ETL pipelines<br/>- Experience working on and delivering end to end projects independently",
